    "passage": "Directions (Q84 - Q90): In the following passage, numbered blanks indicate omitted words. Select the most appropriate option from the choices given.\n\nThe advent of digital technology has fundamentally ...(84)... the traditional contours of retail commercial banking. For over a century, banking relationships were inextricably tied to brick-and-mortar branch infrastructure and physical paper ledgers. However, the confluence of high-speed telecommunications, pervasive smartphone ownership, and open application programming interfaces (APIs) has ...(85)... financial services into intuitive digital experiences.\nNowhere is this paradigm shift more evident than in retail payment clearing. By decoupling financial settlement from physical credit cards and bank branches, platforms like UPI have ...(86)... friction and drastically democratized access to the formal economy. Unbanked individuals can now initiate instant interbank transfers simply by ...(87)... a QR code or entering a mobile number. Yet, this rapid digital transition requires banking institutions to remain ...(88)... against emerging cyber threats. Protecting consumer trust demands robust data ...(89)... architectures, impenetrable firewalls, and rigorous multi-factor authentication. Ultimately, institutions that successfully harmonize technological innovation with uncompromising risk governance will ...(90)... as the undisputed leaders of modern digital finance.",
