    "explanation": "The passage states that mechanisms like CDR and SDR degenerated into 'extend-and-pretend' exercises where banks simply kicked the can down the road by evergreening loans.",
    "source_ref": "SBI Clerk Mains 2018 Solved Paper (Notification CRPD/CR/2017-18/10)",
    "source_url": "https://www.bankersadda.com/sbi-clerk-mains-previous-year-paper/"
