    "topic": "Arithmetic",
    "passage": null,
    "qText": "A boat travels 36 km downstream and 24 km upstream in 6 hours each way? No: If a boat travels 36 km downstream in 3 hours and 24 km upstream in 4 hours, what is the speed of the boat in still water?",
