    "qText": "Two taps P and Q can fill an empty cistern in 24 minutes and 32 minutes respectively. If both taps are opened together, after how many minutes should tap Q be closed so that the cistern gets filled in 18 minutes?",
    "options": [
      "6 minutes",
      "8 minutes",
      "9 minutes",
      "10 minutes",
      "12 minutes"
    ],
    "correctAnswer": 1,
