    "explanation": "For I: (x - 4)(x - 7) = 0 => x = 4, 7.\nFor II: (y - 7)(y - 8) = 0 => y = 7, 8.\nComparing: 4 < 7, 4 < 8; 7 = 7, 7 < 8. Therefore, x \u2264 y.",
