    "topic": "Error Detection",
    "passage": null,
    "qText": "Identify the segment containing a grammatical error:\nNot only the branch manager (A) / but also the assistant credit officers (B) / was held accountable for (C) / the unauthorized loan sanction. (D) / No error (E)",
    "options": [
      "Not only the branch manager",
      "but also the assistant credit officers",
      "was held accountable for",
      "the unauthorized loan sanction",
      "No error"
    ],
    "correctAnswer": 2,
    "explanation": "Subject-verb agreement: In 'not only... but also', the verb agrees with the closer subject ('assistant credit officers' - plural). Hence, it must be 'were held accountable', not 'was'.",
    "source_ref": "SBI Clerk Mains 2022 Solved Paper (Notification CRPD/CR/2022-23/15)",
    "source_url": "https://www.bankersadda.com/sbi-clerk-mains-previous-year-paper/"
