    "passage": null,
    "qText": "What is the cost price of the article?\nStatement I: The article is sold at a discount of 15% on the marked price, generating a profit of 20%.\nStatement II: If the marked price is increased by \u20b9200 and sold at the same discount, the profit increases by \u20b9170.",
