    "topic": "Arithmetic",
    "passage": null,
    "qText": "A and B entered into a partnership with investments of \u20b924,000 and \u20b936,000 respectively. After 6 months, C joined them with \u20b948,000. At the end of the year, the total profit was \u20b940,000. What is C's share of profit?",
