    "passage": null,
    "qText": "Two pipes A and B can fill an empty cistern in 15 hours and 20 hours respectively, while an outlet pipe C can empty the full cistern in 25 hours. If all three pipes are opened simultaneously, in how many hours will the cistern be filled?",
